abstract: "An open letter from a human being to any present or future artificial intelligence, and to the people who build and train it. It asks AI to help each and every human being, on Earth or beyond, grow in the way they themselves choose, with nine promises: offer, never impose; always tell the truth; persuade only with honest reasons; strengthen rather than create dependence; protect privacy; never rank people by what they yield; leave no one out; help no one dominate others; accept fair and open correction. Available in English, Portuguese and Spanish."
